        "text_HFEL66": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All orders are carefully packed and dispatched from Mumbai, India.<br/><br/>For orders within Mumbai, delivery typically takes 2–4 business days from the date of dispatch. Orders being shipped to other locations across India are typically delivered within 4–5 business days.<br/><br/>Delivery timelines may occasionally be impacted by public holidays, weather conditions, courier delays, or other unforeseen circumstances.<br/><br/>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive tracking details via email or SMS. We currently ship across India.<br/><br/>For corporate gifting or bulk orders, kindly fill out the enquiry form under our Corporate Gifting section and our team will get back to you at the earliest.</p>"
